    "description": {
      "value": "You evoke a magical stone and throw it, with divine guide to your aim. The stone deals 2d6 bludgeoning damage depending on your spell attack roll against the target's AC.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The target takes double damage and you can push it up to 10 feet.\n- **Success:** The target takes full damage and you can push it up to 5 feet."
    },
    "higher_level_description": {
      "value": "Heightened (+1): The stone's damage increases by 1d6."
